  "details": "1. Make a stereo audio file with very obvious differences between the Left and Right channel\n\n2. Assign it to an AudioSource component\n\n3. Enter play mode (with ClientSim)\n\n4. You hear both channels\n\n5. Add a VRCSpatialAudioSource component to the same gameobject\n\n6. Enter play mode\n\n7. You hear only the left channel\n\n8. Do a Build & Test\n\n9. In the actual client, you hear both channels",
